{"type":"message","id":"feae966c","parentId":"cd6bece3","timestamp":"2026-05-31T10:22:23.484Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is disappointed with the generated logos. They say it doesn't look right at all. I need to understand what ECHO really is to make better designs. Let me think about the ECHO protocol from my memory and create a better prompt.\n\nECHO is about:\n- 势 (shi/potential) - the \"potential field\" concept\n- Asset protocol\n- It has nodes and edges\n- The concept of \"势位\" (potential position) being in relationships, not tokens\n- 六相 (six phases) of async coupling\n- 归根收益 (returning income)\n\nMaybe I should ask the user what kind of visual direction they want, or I can try different concepts. Let me ask what impression they want to give - maybe they have a specific direction in mind.\n","thinkingSignature":"9df08728df062af23c308668055558c89616ddb9dc48ed5f50197ba96980d4fc"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n说说哪里不对，我来调整：\n\n- **行业风格**：偏金融/DeFi，还是偏技术/极客？\n- **核心意象**：回声/波纹、节点组网、还是资产流动？\n- **颜色**：深色系还是浅色系，主色偏好？\n- **形状**：有具体想法吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1280,"output":228,"cacheRead":40320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41828,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780222938879,"responseId":"066b3edba7a0efef9cd422d9d9164a9f"}}
