{"type":"message","id":"a433f219","parentId":"c7244db4","timestamp":"2026-05-31T12:26:03.802Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to read/summarize the PDF that was attached. Let me look at it more carefully. The PDF is \"echo_simulator_design.pdf\" which seems to be a technical design document for an ECHO system simulator. The user replied \"阅读总结\" meaning \"reading summary\" - they want me to summarize the document.\n\nLet me re-read the PDF more carefully this time.","thinkingSignature":"0fa21b97d27a7ebe1a406b52d1f1f020814463adb3e1034c0c1b8a8329f8311a"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_raox94sbte9s_1","name":"pdf","arguments":{"pages":"1-10","pdf":"/home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/echo_simulator_design---7d0c67a8-2c32-42d6-8211-32f3f8453231.pdf","prompt":"详细阅读并总结这个文档的所有核心内容：项目目标、系统架构、核心模块、数据设计、技术栈等所有重要信息"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1739,"output":195,"cacheRead":42656,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44590,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780230360384,"responseId":"066b5bd95c4db0cd21418467d96fcaaa"}}
