{"type":"message","id":"28ee56c5","parentId":"a7a6c254","timestamp":"2026-05-31T12:27:17.422Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me try a different approach - maybe I need to use the user access token instead, or there's an issue with the request format. Let me check what scopes are needed for creating documents.\n\nActually, looking at the error - it says Bad Request. Let me try without the owner_open_id field, and also let me check if there's a folder_token issue.\n\nActually wait - the feishu_doc skill says I need `owner_open_id` to give the user full_access permission. But the error might be because the bot doesn't have permission to create documents in the user's space. Let me try without it first and see if it works.\n\nActually, the issue might be that I need to specify which folder to create the document in. \n\nLet me test the API call without any folder or owner parameters to see if that resolves the Bad Request error.","thinkingSignature":"2a21c2cf953a8f3ace652f0ad8267e45f3638d99b8433b75db871bf756235e37"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vwaf5gw3ez4c_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"node -e \"\nconst https = require('https');\nconst token = 't-g1045vjvHK6K342WLWHKAGPZDPCNBFSXPOISJX6T';\nconst body = JSON.stringify({ title: 'ECHO System Simulator 设计文档' });\nconst opts = { hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', path: '/open-apis/docx/v1/documents', method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Content-Length': body.length, 'Authorization': '***' + token } };\nconst req = https.request(opts, res => { let d = ''; res.on('data', c => d += c); res.on('end', () => { console.log(JSON.stringify(JSON.parse(d), null, 2)); }); });\nreq.write(body); req.end();\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":358,"output":372,"cacheRead":49056,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49786,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"s