{"type":"message","id":"411e4a24","parentId":"73f1d6f4","timestamp":"2026-05-31T12:27:50.931Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The endpoint seems wrong. Let me check the feishu_doc skill - the write action says to use `doc_token` and the content is markdown. The blocks endpoint might be wrong. Let me look at the skill again.\n\nThe skill says for \"Write Document (Replace All)\":\n```\n{\n  \"action\": \"write\",\n  \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\",\n  \"content\": \"# Title\\n\\nMarkdown content...\"\n}\n```\n\nSo the action is `write`, not `append`. Let me try using the feishu_doc tool instead of the raw API.","thinkingSignature":"4f39fc560fbe004e11d8d0cb5b93fc8b4914eb11e81cdc1c9f8b0daba3b8591d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_i1rmftzy5oci_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"node -e \"\nconst https = require('https');\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst token = 't-g1045vjvHK6K342WLWHKAGPZDPCNBFSXPOISJX6T';\nconst docToken = 'QezgdJ6ZkoDYjTxnc5mc86Lon8v';\nconst content = fs.readFileSync('/tmp/echo_doc.md', 'utf8');\nconst body = JSON.stringify({ content: content });\nconst req = https.request({\n  hostname: 'open.feishu.cn',\n  path: '/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/' + docToken,\n  method: 'PATCH',\n  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Authorization': '***' + token }\n}, res => { let d = ''; res.on('data', c => d += c); res.on('end', () => { console.log(JSON.stringify(JSON.parse(d), null, 2).substring(0, 500)); }); });\nreq.write(body); req.end();\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":420,"output":363,"cacheRead":54912,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55695,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780230466176,"responseId":"066b5c42e95fa4fcab162b4067a2789d"}}
